      "text": "As for thesis on Blacksky ($BKSY) honestly, pretty terrible company. \n\nHowever, Planet Labs $PL + Satellite / Space companies like $RKLB $RDW had a huge spike awhile ago and Blacksky (industry adjacent) hadn't moved at all yet. \n\nIt ended up catching up in price, so it worked.",
